OL,3,GNEWSAInitiative aims to boost region's
OL,4,Aeconomy by #1bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of the East Midlands has
OL,7,Flaunched a new website and initiative
OL,8,Fwith the hope of boosting the region's
OL,9,Fvisitor economy by #1bn.
OL,11,FLabour mayor Claire Ward's Visit East
OL,12,FMidlands partnership is designed to
OL,13,Fraise the profile of the combined
OL,14,Fauthority - which includes Derby,
OL,15,FDerbyshire, Nottingham and
OL,16,FNottinghamshire - as well as to support
OL,17,Fbusinesses.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
