OL,3,GNEWSAInitiative aims to boost region's
OL,4,Aeconomy by #1bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe initiative, alongside its new
OL,7,Fwebsite, was unveiled at an event at
OL,8,FNottingham Castle on Wednesday night,
OL,9,Fwhere Ward outlined the programme's
OL,10,Fambitions.
OL,12,FIt is hoped the initiative will
OL,13,Fincrease overnight stays and build on
OL,14,Fthe success of the region's popular
OL,15,Flandmarks.
